<http://data.silknow.org/object/2ab4ac04-1cc7-3121-85c1-a0d13fa2f4a1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "A flat, square bag of kidskin embroidered with red and green silk thread, silver thread, purl and spangles in a patter of stylized flowers and leaves.  It has a plaited drawstring of red and white silk thread, silver thread loops and finials.  The bag is unlined but has a small kidskin pouch inside with leather drawstring."@en , "This kidskin bag with its simplified floral patterns imitates the elaborate embroidered versions carried by the aristocracy.  The flat, square format with a silk drawstring and tassels is characteristic of bags during the period 1600 to 1650.  Inside it has a small circular pouch closed with a leather drawstring. \n\nThis may have been intended for carrying money on a regular basis, in contrast to bags made of more expensive materials."@en , "Embroidered leather bag, 1635-1650, British; silk metal embroidery with silk strings"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0c60fe2a-8ae5-3a67-84cb-f3d18dba7550> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/db49e755-a756-3f57-b80d-34d4359579bd> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/91bb5d67-f0e6-31c8-9a20-ee0b56e69b09> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1a05738f-5304-3889-bca1-6a89e387208d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "This kidskin bag with its simplified floral patterns imitates the elaborate embroidered versions carried by the aristocracy.  The flat, square format with a silk drawstring and tassels is characteristic of bags during the period 1600 to 1650.  Inside it has a small circular pouch closed with a leather drawstring. \n\nThis may have been intended for carrying money on a regular basis, in contrast to bags made of more expensive materials."@en , "Embroidered leather bag, 1635-1650, British; silk metal embroidery with silk strings"@en , "A flat, square bag of kidskin embroidered with red and green silk thread, silver thread, purl and spangles in a patter of stylized flowers and leaves.  It has a plaited drawstring of red and white silk thread, silver thread loops and finials.  The bag is unlined but has a small kidskin pouch inside with leather drawstring."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/2ab4ac04-1cc7-3121-85c1-a0d13fa2f4a1/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2ab4ac04-1cc7-3121-85c1-a0d13fa2f4a1/dimension/2> ;
